{"parentUuid":"366b78f1-0e70-4d28-ade6-e889d20f8142","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"acfa851c1bf88b5b3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012GxfVUcTzgKrRuqp3r4jKd","type":"tool_result","content":"=== DOMAIN ARCH Engine architecture, governance & agent organization\n  -- ARCH.REQ Requirements & configuration profiles\n  -- ARCH.STRUCT Structure & boundaries\n  -- ARCH.GOV Architecture governance\n  -- ARCH.EVID Research & evidence\n  -- ARCH.ORG Agent organization\n=== DOMAIN PLAT Platform & hardware abstraction\n  -- PLAT.PAL Platform abstraction layer\n  -- PLAT.DESK Desktop & handheld PC\n  -- PLAT.CON Console-class platforms\n  -- PLAT.MOB Mobile & portable\n  -- PLAT.SVC Platform & online services integration\n  -- PLAT.XR XR\n=== DOMAIN CORE Core runtime foundations\n  -- CORE.LIFE Lifecycle, modules, configuration, errors\n  -- CORE.MATH Math & numerics\n  -- CORE.MEM Memory\n  -- CORE.TYPES Core types & containers\n  -- CORE.CONC Concurrency primitives\n  -- CORE.JOBS Jobs, task graphs, fibers\n  -- CORE.FRAME Frame & time orchestration\n  -- CORE.OBJ Object model & identity\n  -- CORE.ECS Entity component system\n  -- CORE.REFL Reflection & metadata\n  -- CORE.SER Serialization & schema\n=== DOMAIN RES Resources, IO, packaging & streaming\n  -- RES.MGMT Runtime resource management\n  -- RES.IO Asynchronous IO\n  -- RES.PKG Packages & virtual file system\n=== DOMAIN CNT Asset identity & content pipeline\n  -- CNT.ID Asset identity & registry\n  -- CNT.IMP Import & interchange\n  -- CNT.COOK Cooking & derived data\n  -- CNT.VAL Content validation\n=== DOMAIN WLD World representation, streaming & environment\n  -- WLD.MODEL World model\n  -- WLD.PART Partitioning & streaming\n  -- WLD.SPACE Transforms & spatial queries\n  -- WLD.ENV Environment systems\n  -- WLD.PCG Procedural generation\n=== DOMAIN RND Rendering\n  -- RND.ARCH Render architecture\n  -- RND.RHI Hardware interface\n  -- RND.MEM GPU memory & resources\n  -- RND.GRAPH Render graph & GPU scheduling\n  -- RND.SHADER Shader system\n  -- RND.MAT Materials\n  -- RND.GEO GPU-driven geometry pipeline\n  -- RND.LOD Level of detail & virtualized geometry\n  -- RND.TEX Textures & virtual texturing\n  -- RND.LIGHT Direct lighting & shadows\n  -- RND.GI Global illumination & reflections\n  -- RND.RT Ray tracing infrastructure\n  -- RND.PT Path tracing\n  -- RND.RECON Reconstruction, resolution & denoising\n  -- RND.POST Post-processing, HDR & color\n  -- RND.TRANS Translucency & decals\n  -- RND.CHAR Character rendering\n  -- RND.2D 2D, vector & UI rendering\n  -- RND.VFX Particles & VFX\n=== DOMAIN ML Machine-learning runtime\n  -- ML.RT Inference\n=== DOMAIN PHY Physics & simulation\n  -- PHY.ARCH Physics architecture\n  -- PHY.COL Collision\n  -- PHY.DYN Rigid-body dynamics\n  -- PHY.CTRL Characters & vehicles\n  -- PHY.SOFT Deformables\n  -- PHY.DEST Destruction\n  -- PHY.FLUID Fluids\n  -- PHY.2D 2D physics\n=== DOMAIN ANM Animation\n  -- ANM.ARCH Animation architecture\n  -- ANM.RT Animation runtime\n  -- ANM.DEF Skinning & deformation\n  -- ANM.GRAPH Animation graphs\n  -- ANM.SYN Motion synthesis\n  -- ANM.IK IK, procedural & physical animation\n  -- ANM.FACE Facial animation\n  -- ANM.CINE Cinematics\n=== DOMAIN AUD Audio\n  -- AUD.ARCH Audio architecture\n  -- AUD.DSP DSP & mixing\n  -- AUD.SPAT Spatial audio & acoustics\n  -- AUD.CONTENT Audio content runtime\n=== DOMAIN INP Input\n  -- INP.DEV Devices\n  -- INP.ACT Actions\n=== DOMAIN NET Networking & multiplayer\n  -- NET.ARCH Network architecture\n  -- NET.TRANS Transport\n  -- NET.REP Replication\n  -- NET.PRED Prediction & latency hiding\n  -- NET.SRV Servers\n=== DOMAIN GAM Gameplay, scripting, AI & persistence\n  -- GAM.FW Gameplay framework\n  -- GAM.SYS Gameplay systems toolkit\n  -- GAM.SCR Scripting\n  -- GAM.AI Navigation, crowds & AI\n  -- GAM.SAVE Persistence\n=== DOMAIN UI UI, text, localization & accessibility\n  -- UI.FW UI framework\n  -- UI.TXT Text & fonts\n  -- UI.LOC Localization\n  -- UI.A11Y Accessibility\n=== DOMAIN ED Editor & content tools\n  -- ED.ARCH Editor architecture\n  -- ED.UI Editor UI framework\n  -- ED.WORLD World editor\n  -- ED.GRAPH Graph editors\n  -- ED.COLLAB Collaboration & version control\n  -- ED.DEBUG Visual debugging\n  -- ED.AI AI-assisted authoring\n=== DOMAIN BLD Build, CI/CD & release\n  -- BLD.SYS Build system\n  -- BLD.CI CI/CD & automation\n  -- BLD.REL Packaging & release\n=== DOMAIN QA Testing & validation\n  -- QA.STRAT Test strategy\n  -- QA.RENDER Rendering validation\n  -- QA.FUNC Functional & stability testing\n  -- QA.ROBUST Robustness\n  -- QA.CERT Certification & compliance\n=== DOMAIN PRF Performance engineering\n  -- PRF.METH Method & budgets\n  -- PRF.BENCH Benchmarking\n  -- PRF.CPU CPU performance\n  -- PRF.GPU GPU performance\n  -- PRF.LOAD Loading & hitches\n=== DOMAIN OBS Observability & diagnostics\n  -- OBS.LOG Instrumentation\n  -- OBS.CRASH Crash & hang diagnostics\n=== DOMAIN XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines\n  -- XC.DET Determinism & replay\n  -- XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration\n  -- XC.SEC Security\n  -- XC.EXT Extensibility & evolution\n  -- XC.DX Documentation & developer experience","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c830b176-eddb-4546-bc8e-5bc4658e6e4c","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:48:37.184Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"366b78f1-0e70-4d28-ade6-e889d20f8142","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
